==English==

===Etymology===
Probably a {{blend|en|squirm|wiggle|nocap=1}}<ref>{{R:Etymonline}}</ref>

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|en|ɪɡəl}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# a [[short]] [[twisting]] or [[wiggling]] [[line]] or [[mark]]
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1939|author=Flora Thompson|title=Lark Rise|passage=Even the cold ashes where a gipsy's fire had been sent little '''squiggles''' of fear down Laura's spine, for how could she know that they were not still lurking near with designs upon her own person?}}
# {{lb|en|informal}} the [[tilde]]
# an [[illegible]] [[scrawl]]

